Package: com.wifitether
Name: WiFi Tether
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64
Section: Networking
Depends: firmware (>= 15.0)
Recommends: com.rostane.share, python3
Maintainer: WiFi Tether
Author: WiFi Tether
Homepage: https://github.com/scog3/iOS-WiFi-tether
Icon: https://scog3.github.io/iOS-WiFi-tether/icon.png
SileoDepiction: https://scog3.github.io/iOS-WiFi-tether/depiction.json
Depiction: https://scog3.github.io/iOS-WiFi-tether/depiction.html
Description: Plug-and-play USB tethering: share your iPhone's Wi-Fi, or its VPN, with a computer. No SIM or data plan, nothing to set up on the computer, no speed cap. Change VPN location while plugged in and the computer follows within a second or two. Needs the Share tweak; the app has a button that adds its repo in Sileo.
